{"nodes": [{"id": "worker_readme_manna_parse", "label": "manna-parse Cloudflare Worker", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "worker/README.md", "source_location": "L1-6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A deliberately separate Worker so the PWA's own deploy (../wrangler.jsonc) stays pure static assets. It is the only place the Anthropic API key lives, and the key never reaches the browser."}, {"id": "worker_readme_nl_capture", "label": "Natural-language capture", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "worker/README.md", "source_location": "L8-10", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'200 on Jollibee today' returns a transaction draft that the add sheet opens on the review panel. Nothing is written until the user confirms \u2014 the same approve-don't-auto-write stance applied to parsing."}, {"id": "worker_readme_add_draft", "label": "AddDraft (parsed transaction draft)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "worker/README.md", "source_location": "L38-45", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Response shape is { draft, confidence } where draft carries kind, amountCents, categoryId and note, and is passed straight to <AddSheet draft={draft} />."}, {"id": "worker_readme_shared_parse_module", "label": "Shared parse module (src/parse.ts)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "worker/README.md", "source_location": "L45-47", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The prompt, the id-pinned schema and the validation all live in ../src/parse.ts, shared verbatim between Worker and app and unit-tested in ../src/parse.test.ts \u2014 so the client and server can never disagree about the draft shape."}, {"id": "worker_readme_post_contract", "label": "POST / request contract", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "worker/README.md", "source_location": "L25-34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Body carries sentence plus the live category and wallet lists from useCategories()/useWallets(), and an optional today for resolving 'today'/'yesterday' in the user's local date. Sending the live lists is what lets the model pin real ids instead of inventing names."}, {"id": "worker_readme_app_token", "label": "APP_TOKEN soft gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "worker/README.md", "source_location": "L69-73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It ships in the PWA bundle so it is a soft gate, not a hard secret: with the CORS origin allowlist it deters casual abuse of a paid endpoint. Cloudflare Access in front of the Worker is the noted path to a hard gate."}, {"id": "worker_readme_anthropic_key", "label": "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY kept server-side", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "worker/README.md", "source_location": "L4-6, L12-18", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stored as a Wrangler secret in Cloudflare, never in the repo. This is the one credential that must stay server-side, and separating the Worker from the static PWA deploy is what guarantees it."}, {"id": "worker_readme_cors_allowlist", "label": "ALLOWED_ORIGINS CORS allowlist", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "worker/README.md", "source_location": "L20-21", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Configured in worker/wrangler.jsonc and must be edited to the real PWA origins before deploying; pairs with APP_TOKEN as the second half of the soft gate."}], "edges": [{"source": "worker_readme_manna_parse", "target": "worker_readme_nl_capture", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "worker/README.md", "source_location": "L1-10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "worker_re